     "Lower instalment, less total interest",
     "Nothing changes"
    ],
    "correct": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "q_cb3",
    "domain": "credit_borrowing",
    "text": "You miss a buy-now-pay-later instalment. What is the most likely result?",
